{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26123","headline":"和兵部郑侍郎省中四松诗 · 陶雍","name":"和兵部郑侍郎省中四松诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"右相历兵署，四松皆手栽。\n斸时惊鹤去，移处带云来。\n根倍双桐植，花分八桂开。\n生成造化力，长作栋梁材。\n岂羡兰依省，犹嫌柏占台。\n出楼终百尺，入梦已三台。\n幽韵和宫漏，余香度酒杯。\n拂冠枝上雪，染履影中苔。\n高位相承地，新诗寡和才。\n何由比萝蔓，攀附在条枚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶雍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}